msgid "Element-wise modulo (``lf % other``)."
msgstr "元素级取模运算（``lf % other``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.mod:3 of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``%`` operator (``__mod__``), so ``lf % other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.mod(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``%`` 运算符（``__mod__``），所以 ``lf % other`` 等价于 ``lf.mod("
"other)``。"

