#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.mod:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with element-wise remainder of ``lf`` divided by ``other``."
msgstr "包含 ``lf`` 除以 ``other`` 的元素级余数的惰性框架。"

